      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "第3题 甲醛是一种重要的化工产品,可利用甲醇脱氢制备,反应式如下:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{OH(g)} \\xrightarrow {\\text {催化剂,} 700 ^ {\\circ} \\mathrm{C}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {2} \\mathrm{O(g)} + \\mathrm{H} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g})"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "H _ {m} ^ {\\ominus} = 84.2 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}\\tag{1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "向体系中通入空气,通过以下反应提供反应(1)所需热量:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\\mathrm{H} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g}) + 0.5 \\mathrm{O} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g}) \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} (\\mathrm{g})"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "H _ {m} ^ {\\ominus} = - 241.8 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}\\tag{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "要使反应温度维持在 $700 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$ ,计算进料中甲醇与空气的摩尔数之比.已知空气中氧气的体积分数为0.20."
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-002395"
    }
  ],
  "renderingHints": {
    "mhchem": true
  }
}
